cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this package, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "USDC holders and the 2022 Tornado Cash freezes: data-construction pipeline (15 October 2026 snapshot)"
abstract: "The 15 October 2026 construction snapshot of the data pipeline for the paper 'Issuer Discretion and Stablecoin Holdings after the Tornado Cash Sanction' (Khosravipour, 2026). It rebuilds the cohort exposed to Circle's 2022 USDC freezes from raw Ethereum mainnet JSON-RPC calls, through gate g2. It is not the code behind the paper's numbers; that code, signed on 28 October 2026, follows in a versioned replication release."
authors:
  - family-names: Khosravipour
    given-names: Nik
repository-code: "https://github.com/nik110403/tornado-usdc"
url: "https://nikkhosravipour.com"
license: MIT
